sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant ClientCache as Client Cache
    participant Server

    Client->>ClientCache: GET /page
    ClientCache->>Server: GET /page
    Server-->>ClientCache: Page Content
    ClientCache-->>Client: Page Content

    Client->>ClientCache: GET /resource (preload)
    ClientCache->>Server: GET /resource

    Client->>ClientCache: GET /script.js
    ClientCache->>Server: GET /script.js
    Server-->>ClientCache: Script Content
    ClientCache-->>Client: Script Content

    Client->>Client: Execute Script
    Client->>ClientCache: GET /resource (fetch from script)

    ClientCache->>ClientCache: Hold fetch
    
    Server-->>ClientCache: /resource Content

    ClientCache-->>Client: /resource Content